import pathlib,json,datetime
root=pathlib.Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];summ=json.load(open(root/'results/summary.json'));comp=json.load(open(root/'results/final_compute.json'))
def ci(a,scale=1):return f'[{a[0]*scale:.2f}, {a[1]*scale:.2f}]'
lines=['# 027r: fair DiffusionGemma quality comparison','',f"**Verdict: {summ[-1]['verdict']}** under the prewritten exact McNemar rule.",'','Both arms received byte-identical GSM8K prompts with thinking disabled and a 4096-token cap. Both Q4_K_M models ran on the same NVIDIA L4 with 8 CPU expert layers, context 8192, one independent turn per question. DG used its native entropy-bound sampler (seed 27); Gemma 4 used greedy decoding. Each model stayed loaded within a round; no conversation history or AR prompt cache was retained. Public questions were randomly sampled without replacement with seed 27.','', '| Look | Paired n | DG correct (Wilson 95% CI) | Gemma 4 correct (Wilson 95% CI) | DG minus AR, pp (paired bootstrap 95% CI) | DG-only / AR-only | Exact McNemar p | Verdict |','|---|---:|---|---|---|---:|---:|---|']
for s in summ:
 a,b=s['dg'],s['ar'];lines+=[f"| {s['round']} | {s['n']} | {a['correct']}/{s['n']} ({ci(a['accuracy_ci'],100)}%) | {b['correct']}/{s['n']} ({ci(b['accuracy_ci'],100)}%) | {s['difference']*100:+.2f} {ci(s['difference_ci'],100)} | {s['dg_only']} / {s['ar_only']} | {s['mcnemar_p']:.6g} | {s['verdict']} |"]
s=summ[-1];lines+=['','Two fixed looks at n=150 and, only if inconclusive, cumulative n=300 use p<.025 each (Bonferroni familywise alpha .05). The second look adds 150 disjoint items, reversing arm execution order. Bootstrap intervals use 20,000 paired resamples and are descriptive 95% intervals; the exact test determines the verdict. A nonsignificant result does not demonstrate equivalence.','','| Model | Median useful tokens/s | Bootstrap 95% CI | Suspected cap hits | Nonempty thought channels |','|---|---:|---|---:|---:|']
for arm,label in [('dg','DiffusionGemma'),('ar','Gemma 4')]:
 a=s[arm];lines+=[f"| {label} | {a['median_tokens_s']:.2f} | {ci(a['median_speed_ci'])} | {a['cap_suspect']} | {a['thought_channel_emitted']} |"]
lines+=['',f"95% paired-bootstrap CI for the difference in median useful throughput (DG minus AR): {ci(s['median_speed_difference_ci'])} tokens/s.",'','Useful tokens exclude diffusion canvas padding and are counted with the same Gemma tokenizer. The denominator includes prompt processing and generation, excludes model loading: DG native turn time versus AR server prompt_ms + predicted_ms. This is useful turn throughput, not a pure decode-kernel benchmark. Different native samplers remain a limitation. Offload is matched; these speeds cannot be substituted for the original all-GPU speeds.','','The DG experimental adapter disables automatic chat rendering and adds a record-separated input loop; every invocation constructs a new prompt prefix. The patch and pilot outputs are retained. A preliminary overlapping-probe AR load ran out of GPU memory before scoring; scored runs use sequential arms with only one model resident. The two-item pilot is excluded. All scored prompts are checked against the staged rendered string, and nonempty thought channels invalidate analysis.','','The earlier interrupted attempt ended before its first scored round launched. Its scripts, public data and preregistration command are retained. The recovery amended the second-look sample target before scoring after discovering the earlier compute allocation. No original experiment files were changed.','',f"Compute: NVIDIA L4; recovery {comp['recovery_minutes_upper']:.2f} minutes x 1.54 CU/hour = {comp['recovery_cu_upper']:.3f} CU upper estimate. Earlier interrupted allocation reserved at <=1.70 CU; **total <= {comp['total_cu_upper']:.3f} CU**, below 5 CU. Account-level before/after usage is retained; another assignment used the shared account, so balance subtraction is not experiment-only usage. This session was explicitly stopped. No A100 was used.",'','Sources: [public GSM8K test data](https://github.com/openai/grade-school-math/blob/master/grade_school_math/data/test.jsonl), [native diffusion implementation](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/24423), [Gemma chat template](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it/blob/main/tokenizer_config.json).','', 'Reproduce: stage scripts/setup.sh on a dedicated L4; apply scripts/patch_raw_prompt.py and scripts/patch_stream.py; stage scripts/prompts.json; run scripts/stream_run.py once per allowed round, with OFFLOAD=8 and a CU deadline; download results; run scripts/analyze.py then scripts/report.py. Never run preflight probes simultaneously with scored models.']
if not s['complete']:lines+=['','The final round did not reach its fixed target before the CU deadline. Its intervals are descriptive; the experiment remains STILL INCONCLUSIVE. No third round was attempted.']
(root/'writeup.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n')
readme=(root/'README.md').read_text();readme+='\n## Completed result\n\n'+f"Verdict: **{s['verdict']}**. DG {s['dg']['correct']}/{s['n']}; Gemma 4 {s['ar']['correct']}/{s['n']}; exact McNemar p={s['mcnemar_p']:.6g}. DG minus AR {s['difference']*100:+.2f} percentage points, paired bootstrap 95% CI {ci(s['difference_ci'],100)}. Median useful throughput {s['dg']['median_tokens_s']:.2f} vs {s['ar']['median_tokens_s']:.2f} tokens/s. GPU: NVIDIA L4. Total CU upper estimate including prior allocation: {comp['total_cu_upper']:.3f}; recovery session stopped. See writeup.md and chart.png.\n"
(root/'README.md').write_text(readme)
